格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"可以恢复归档的插件Archived-session recycle bin for DeepSeek Harness: list, preview and restore archived sessions昨天手滑归档了个会话花了几百万才捞出来，所以做了这个。","id":"gh:1335980816","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-unarchive","slug":"uwu9039/dsh-unarchive","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"可以恢复归档的插件Archived-session recycle bin for DeepSeek Harness: list, preview and restore archived sessi"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ons昨天手滑归档了个会话花了几百万才捞出来，所以做了这个。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-unarchive"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"归档会话回收站 · An archived-session recycle bin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"查看已归档会话、预览内容、恢复到原工作区；另有一个默认关闭的归档二次确认开关。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"List archived sessions, preview their content, and restore them to their original workspace. An opti"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"onal archive confirmation (off by default) is included."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> 独立第三方插件，与 DeepSeek 无隶属关系。Independent third-party plugin, not affiliated with DeepSeek."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 功能 / Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 功能 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| 归档列表 | 右下角悬浮按钮打开浮层面板，按工作区分组、组内按创建时间倒序；空态、总数、中英文界面 |\n| 内容预览 | 行内展开会话开头与最近消息：第一条用户消息、最近 1–2 条消息文本、消息"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"/工具统计、最后活动时间；单条 ≤200 字符，只提取 `text` 块，不展示工具参数与附件 |\n| 单个恢复 | 幂等、存在性校验、串行写入；恢复后侧边栏即时回到原工作区原位置（不刷新页面、多标签"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"页同步） |\n| 全部恢复 | 列表 ≥2 条时可用，面板内二次确认，逐个恢复，失败项不整体回滚 |\n| 归档二次确认 | 默认关闭；开启后从侧边栏右键归档前弹确认框（Esc / 遮罩 / 取消均可取"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"消）；包装 `workspaces.archiveSession`，fail-open |\n| 设置 | 面板「设置」页签：`confirmOnArchive` / `showButton` / `p"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"reviewEnabled`；即时生效，持久化到 `~/.dsh/unarchive/settings.json` |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 安装 / Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"已发布到 npm，直接安装："},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"也可以本地打包安装："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"官方参考：打包与安装插件 (basic/publish)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 配置 / Configuration"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"`cordis.yml` 的 `config:` 块（Schemastery 校验，默认值见 schema）："},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 兼容性 / Compatibility"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- 目标 DSH `0.1.0-rc.6`，profile `web`。\n- 依赖公开服务：`workspaceRegistry`（`archivedSessionIds` 为公开 API；恢复走 `"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"enqueueOperation` / `requireState` / `setState` / `sessionKnown`，与原生 `archiveSession` 同一串行化队列）、`sess"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ionQuery`（列表/标题/预览）、`webServer`（HTTP API）、客户端 `workspaces` / `locale` / `timer`。\n- 任一依赖缺失即相应功能降级，不阻塞"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"原生归档（fail-open）。\n- 卸载后仅残留设置文件 `~/.dsh/unarchive/settings.json`，其余由插件清理还原。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 架构 / Architecture"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"数据流："},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 边界 / Out of scope"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"不做删除/清空归档、不做归档内容搜索、不做\"恢复并打开\"、不兼容 `headless` UI、不展示工具参数与附件。"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 许可 / License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT。"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
